WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.168
On your Windows computer or Mac, open the YAIP website shown here. Choose
Download, find LG TV, and open Set up on my LG TV.

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:17.292
On the LG setup page, click Download LG test kit. Wait for the download to
finish. You will find the ZIP in your Downloads folder.

00:00:17.503 --> 00:00:25.915
On Windows, open Downloads. Right-click the ZIP and choose Extract All. In the
next window, click Extract. Open the folder it creates.

00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:34.059
On a Mac, open Downloads and double-click the ZIP. Then open the folder it
creates. If your browser already unpacked the ZIP, open that folder.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:39.839
Keep these files together, including the files folder. Follow only the Windows
or Mac steps for your computer.

00:00:40.366 --> 00:00:42.815
We will open the installer after getting the TV ready.

00:00:43.102 --> 00:00:51.792
Make sure your computer and LG TV are on the same home network, with internet
access. Wi-Fi or a network cable is fine. Avoid a guest network.

00:00:51.973 --> 00:01:00.940
In the YAIP guide, open LG’s account and Developer Mode guide. Choose Sign In.
Create a free LG developer account, or sign in to yours.

00:01:01.094 --> 00:01:03.036
Complete any setup LG asks for.

00:01:03.907 --> 00:01:11.821
On your TV, press Home on the remote. Open Apps or LG Content Store. Search
for Developer Mode, select it, and choose Install.

00:01:12.223 --> 00:01:17.361
Open Developer Mode on the TV. Sign in with the email and password for your LG
developer account.

00:01:18.194 --> 00:01:23.371
Find Dev Mode Status and turn it on. The TV will restart. Let it finish before
continuing.

00:01:23.659 --> 00:01:26.587
When the TV has restarted, open Developer Mode again.

00:01:26.922 --> 00:01:32.253
Now turn on Key Server. Leave this Developer Mode screen open while you return
to your computer.

00:01:32.779 --> 00:01:40.885
Find IP Address and Passphrase on that screen. You will type these into the
installer. Your TV’s values will be different from our examples.

00:01:41.583 --> 00:01:47.181
Back in the extracted kit folder, Windows users double-click Install on
Windows dot cmd.

00:01:48.119 --> 00:01:53.287
Mac users double-click Install on Mac dot command. Only open the installer for
your computer.

00:01:54.225 --> 00:02:03.718
If Windows shows Windows protected your PC for the kit from the YAIP website,
choose More info, then Run anyway if offered. Keep Windows protection on.

00:02:04.244 --> 00:02:10.033
If your Mac blocks this installer as an unidentified developer, open System
Settings, then Privacy and Security.

00:02:11.163 --> 00:02:16.454
Find the installer’s message, choose Open Anyway, and confirm Open. For other
warnings, check the guide.

00:02:16.838 --> 00:02:23.172
A text window opens. That is the installer. You do not need to write commands.
Just answer its two questions.

00:02:23.326 --> 00:02:31.068
When it asks for the TV IP address, read IP Address on your TV. Type those
numbers, including the dots, then press Enter on your keyboard.

00:02:31.517 --> 00:02:37.948
Next, type the Passphrase from that same TV screen and press Enter. Match
capital and small letters exactly.

00:02:38.446 --> 00:02:41.202
Use your TV’s passphrase, not your LG account password.

00:02:41.987 --> 00:02:49.844
The kit now connects, copies the app, and installs YAIP. Keep your TV on and
wait. This can take a minute. Our example is sped up.

00:02:50.035 --> 00:02:58.849
Wait for Done. YAIP should open on your TV. If it does not, open it from the
TV’s app list. Add your own playlist; YAIP does not provide content.

00:02:59.232 --> 00:03:05.729
Keep Developer Mode on. Check its timer regularly and press Extend before it
reaches zero, while connected to the internet.

00:03:06.113 --> 00:03:09.653
If Developer Mode expires or is disabled, test apps are removed.

00:03:09.892 --> 00:03:16.333
If anything goes wrong, return to the same written guide. It has help for
Windows, Mac, and connecting to your TV.

00:03:16.945 --> 00:03:19.166
Pause this video whenever you need more time.
